   3 files.write.new       change   here  Write a new file in Files, holding the text given.
   4 files.write.revision  change   here  Save a new revision of a file in Files: the text given replaces its text, and the revision before is kept.
   5 files.rename          change   here  Rename a file or a folder in Files; it keeps its identity.
   6 files.move            change   here  Move a file or a folder into another folder of Files; it keeps its identity.
   7 files.folder.new      change   here  Make a folder in Files.
   8 calculation.recheck   change   here  Work a calculation page again from its sheet as it is now: a new page replaces the old one.
